        // Storage (lithium-ion, 4 hours). Capital [P7-IN-009] [P7-US-022]: the
        // VGF scheme's 9.4e10 INR for 4,000 MWh, 94,000 INR/kW of a 4-hour
        // system x (500 / 1,744 = 0.28670) = 26,949.5, so 26,900 INR/kW x
        // 200,000 kW = 5,380,000,000. Fixed O&M [P7-IN-023] [P7-US-024]: 1% of
        // that capex, 940 INR/kW-yr x (6.0 / 40.0 = 0.15) = 141 x 200,000 / 12
        // = 2,350,000. Build [P7-IN-024] [P7-US-023]: 6 months x (2 / 12) = 1
        // month (ruling 1, sourced; storage has no ceiling). Storage windows (spec section 29):
